    .desc = Crunches, greens, and attempts photosynthesis even in the refrigerator. Do not water! Smells like grass.
# [AUTO_EN]
ent-FoodMeatFelinid = felinid meat
    .desc = Purring when warmed up. Hissing when looked at. Perfect for felinoids and bad ideas.
# [AUTO_EN]
ent-FoodMeatMilira = Milira meat
    .desc = A delicately and indirectly sweet piece of meat. A slight aftertaste in the mouth.
