    .desc = Usually contains little fat, tender texture, and easy digestibility.
# [AUTO_EN]
ent-FoodMeatSlimeJelly = slime jelly
    .desc = Jelly that defies the laws of physics and cutlery. If you blink, you saw nothing.
# [AUTO_EN]
ent-FoodMeatSwine = meat trimmings
    .desc = Fresh, high-quality pork has a neutral odor without any repelling notes.
# [AUTO_EN]
ent-FoodMeatTajaran = meat tajara
    .desc = So why did you ingredient-ify Barsik? A cat soup was just a joke.
# [AUTO_EN]
ent-FoodMeatUnath = unath meat
    .desc = Scaly and elastic. The knife begs for a break after it.
# [AUTO_EN]
ent-FoodMeatVulpkanin = vulpkanin meat
    .desc = Suspiciously unwholesome, repulsive, and despised pink meat. Holy water is a mandatory marinade to remove the immoral filth. Show mercy to the Universe: stop the very existence of this defective race! The world must not be further defiled by the birth of creatures with this repulsive flesh!
# [AUTO_EN]
ent-FoodNianRamenBowl = Nian Nian Ramen
    .desc = Exotic for those who don't shun street fast food. While you eat, a strange taste of dusty attic and old clothes builds in your mouth. The secret of the ingredients is kept under strict secrecy. Serving under dim light is the only way to avoid seeing that your food suspiciously resembles processed wings...
# [AUTO_EN]
ent-FoodSaladDiona = Dionysian salad
    .desc = A set of regenerating plant tissues that still consider themselves sentient. While you eat it, it attempts to photosynthesize from the light of your lamp. The manufacturer guarantees: the seeds do not take root in the mucous membrane, and a tree will not grow in the lungs. At least not immediately. The guarantee is valid strictly until the moment of swallowing. If, after the meal, you feel a craving for the earth and the sun, consult the nearest botanist. Or an exorcist.
# [AUTO_EN]
ent-FoodSoupRoyalXeno = royal stew
    .desc = Concentrated solution of organic acid in a deep bowl. The rule is simple: if the soup is bubbling, it's ready to eat. If it stops bubbling, it means it's already digesting a spoonful and preparing to come to you. Recommended to eat in a chemical suit.
# [AUTO_EN]
ent-FoodSoupFacehugger = soup from facehugger
    .desc = Soup Facehugger. Hugs with flavor. Spoon included, face not.
# [AUTO_EN]
ent-FoodDemonHellChiliBowl = hellish arcane chili
    .desc = It's like my hot ex-wife. The spicy aroma tempts, and the first bite burns the soul. I couldn't let go of her after the farewell dinner, so I simply placed her on the table. Swallow the black flame and stay silent. In a world where nothing is left alive, we eat those we love just to survive until dawn. Only darkness lies ahead.
# [AUTO_EN]
ent-FoodMealBakedResomi = fried resomi
    .desc = A gastronomic masterpiece that makes your heart race. The exquisite skin of this tiny bird is baked to a crystalline caramelized sheen, revealing beneath it incredibly tender, juicy pink meat.
# [AUTO_EN]
ent-FoodMealMiliraWingsBarbecue = Milira wings in holy sauce
    .desc = This breading seals an angelic spirit doomed to sing under the crushing pressure of your jaws. The chef had to confess three times, for this crunch is your greatest sin, which will never be forgiven in heaven. Enjoy your dominion over the heavens: hell will wait.
# [AUTO_EN]
ent-FoodSlimeBun = slime bun
    .desc = Thermally processed biopolymer with high fructose content. Due to the semi-sentient nature of the raw material, the bun exhibits signs of motor activity and attempts to escape the plate.
# [AUTO_EN]
ent-FoodMealUnathCarpNachos = unatth nachos
    .desc = Nachos that bite back. Carp adds flavor: well, it's over.
# [AUTO_EN]
ent-FoodRagoutLeTrottinBowl = ragout Le'Trottin
    .desc = Ragu, after which the refrigerator respects you. And a little bit fears.
# [AUTO_EN]
ent-FoodTajawarma = tajawarma
    .desc = That very legendary delicacy from the dubious kiosk at the subway transfer station. While you're tearing into this juicy wrap, images of your missing neighbor's cat, Barsik, inexplicably flash before your eyes, and a lonely meow echoes in your head...
# [AUTO_EN]
ent-FoodFelmeniBowl = felmeni
    .desc = Felmenni: when dumplings and felinids met in the microwave and didn't part ways.
# [AUTO_EN]
ent-FoodVulpLoaf = vulpian roulette
    .desc = Genetic garbage distilled down to a single useful denominator. Thank you for purging the racial filth. Do a service to humanity—devour this repulsive parasitic flesh and ensure that such creatures are never born again. There is no place in the galaxy for this disgusting filth—only in the meat grinder! Sterilize the sector from their unbearable stench until the last scion of this despised race has perished! Destroy, digest, dominate. May the eternal glory of Humanity shine forth!
